okf_version: "1.0"
task: "Kobe (.14 u24) turns stop too often: troubleshoot. Read-only over ssh -p 1004 (SYSTEM); scripts sent inline (python -c base64), nothing written on the host."
reported: "User, 2026-10-08: 'kobi 세션에서 턴끊김이 심한이유 터르뷸슈팅'."
evidence:
  rollout: "rollout 00347d86 (315 MB). 2026-10-05T21:00Z..2026-10-08T18:15Z: 811 task_started, 809 task_complete, 2 open (10-07), 0 turn_aborted, 0 error/stream_error/warning events."
  tools_per_turn: "Function/custom tool calls per turn by day: 10-02 70.9 (10 turns), 10-03 5.9, 10-04 0.6, 10-05 2.8, 10-06 2.0, 10-07 12.1, 10-08 1.5 (250 turns)."
  effort_history: "turn_context (model, effort) changes: 10-01T09:14Z gpt-6.1-sol high; 10-02T01:11Z gpt-6-sol high; 10-03T17:19Z gpt-6.1-sol effort=None, unchanged for every turn since (1061 turn_context rows after offset 150 MB)."
  codex_config: "C:\Users\aapw-a24u24\.codex\config.toml: 42 bytes, only a [tui] table, no model / model_reasoning_effort; mtime 2026-10-02 14:10:38 local (Pacific) = 21:10Z. Ciel config providers.codex has no effort_level; launch-state mode codex-remote-router, model empty."
  catalog: "Kobe models_cache.json gpt-6.1-sol: default_reasoning_level low, default_verbosity low."
  continue_run: "2026-10-08 17:20-17:44Z: 14 consecutive turns started by a human 'continue'; each ended in 20-260 s with 1-16 tool calls and a final_answer status report (e.g. '...계속 진행 중입니다')."
  goal: "goals_1.sqlite: one goal on 00347d86 (P1 QuickBooks marketplace), created 2026-10-07 14:22Z, status blocked, updated 22:22Z. 10-07 is the only day with ~12 tools/turn since 10-03."
  last_usage: "Last call 18:15Z: input 108,881 (cached 107,264), output 95, reasoning 0; context window 258,400."
findings:
  - "✅ No turn was cut by an error, abort or disconnect; every turn ended with a normal task_complete after a final_answer."
  - "✅ Since the 10-03 17:19Z relaunch every turn runs with no reasoning effort configured; before that it was high/medium. The Codex config file that would hold it was reduced to [tui] only on 10-02 21:10Z."
  - "✅ Turns since then are short (1.5-2.8 tool calls/turn outside the goal day) vs 70.9 on 10-02 at high."
  - "🟡 That Codex sends effort 'low' for Kobe now is inferred from the catalog default and the 10-06 local capture, not captured on Kobe."
  - "🟡 That low effort causes the short turns is a correlation, not shown: the turn mix also changed (most turns now start from channel notifications that need only an acknowledgement)."
  - "🟡 What rewrote config.toml on 10-02 14:10 local is not known."
incident: "First attempt piped the script into 'python -' over ssh; Python opened its REPL instead (WinError 123 loop). That process (pid 2512, started 10:47:07 local) and a second stuck stdin attempt (pid 12320) were mine and were stopped. No other process was touched."
